<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech utility Severoceska H1 profit falls.</title>
<headline>Czech utility Severoceska H1 profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six month period ending June 30, 1997, according to Czech accounting standards (in millions of crowns):</p>
<p> Gross profit		  69.47   vs	348.43</p>
<p> Operating profit	   122.85   vs	337.08</p>
